-- The middle of a three-module chain, for `chain-refused.l4`. Like
-- `implicit-rate-lib.l4` this typechecks fine and is in no golden glob.
--
-- It declares no section GIVEN of its own. That is the point: a module in the
-- middle of a chain has an empty read-set, so it used to contribute nothing to
-- what its importers were told, and the refusal missed anything one hop further
-- out.

IMPORT `implicit-rate-lib`

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`wrapped cost of` amount MEANS `scaled by the rate` amount
